{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-6430a5cd-5dda-4fad-b08e-ad1abad8a88f-12\nfc_0d49d1d9-2717-948c-88de-b989febca5a8_1","tool_call":{"grepToolCall":{"args":{"pattern":"MARATHON-21|auth-error|huddle\\.token|app-shell|acceptance","path":"/work","glob":"*.{md,txt,yml,yaml}","caseInsensitive":false,"headLimit":80,"multiline":false,"toolCallId":"call-6430a5cd-5dda-4fad-b08e-ad1abad8a88f-12\nfc_0d49d1d9-2717-948c-88de-b989febca5a8_1","offset":0},"result":{"success":{"pattern":"MARATHON-21|auth-error|huddle\\.token|app-shell|acceptance","path":"/work","outputMode":"content","workspaceResults":{"/work/critic-MARATHON-21-1":{"content":{"matches":[{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-195636-qa-engineer-1--efab2702/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":44,"content":"- You write and run tests against the design's acceptance criteria. Tests, fixtures, and test helpers are yours to write.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":79,"content":"- Copy the design's acceptance criteria into an explicit list, including every negative case","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-195435-frontend-dev-1--a791e5ab/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":52,"content":"A task is already claimed for you: **MARATHON-21**. Work on that one and no other.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":54,"content":"ID: MARATHON-21","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":63,"content":"Serve SPA from GET / on any node. Sign-up/login form with visible validation errors; auto-login on success; logout/login restores workspace. Store token in localStorage huddle.token. Pin data-testid: auth-form, auth-submit, auth-toggle, current-user, logout-btn; ids auth-modal. Drivable at 1280x900.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":68,"content":"MARATHON-21 delivers the Huddle browser shell: every HTTP node serves a same-origin SPA at `GET /`, and that SPA owns sign-up/login UI, visible validation errors, auto-login after success, session restore via `localStorage` key `huddle.token`, and logout that returns the user to the auth modal. It consumes the already-landed MARATHON-3 contracts (`POST /api/auth/register`, `POST /api/auth/login`, `GET /api/auth/me`) without adding auth APIs, and leaves a documented authenticated-shell mount point for MARATHON-22 (workspaces/channels/messages) and MARATHON-23 (threads/settings). Pinned DOM hooks (`data-testid` / `id`) make the auth flow automatable at **1280×900**.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":74,"content":"2. **Same-origin `fetch`** to `/api/auth/*` with `Content-Type: application/json`. Token persistence **only** at `localStorage['huddle.token']` (exact key per MARATHON-3). Authenticated calls send `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":75,"content":"3. **Client-owned logout:** clear `huddle.token`, clear in-memory session/user, show `#auth-modal`. No `POST /api/auth/logout` (explicitly out of MARATHON-3; server tokens may remain until a future revoke task).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":78,"content":"   - **Authenticated shell:** modal hidden; chrome shows `current-user` + `logout-btn`; a `#app-shell` placeholder hosts future MARATHON-22 content (empty or minimal “signed in” copy is fine; **must not** invent workspace/channel APIs here).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":79,"content":"5. **Boot sequence:** on `DOMContentLoaded`, if `huddle.token` is set → `GET /api/auth/me` → success enters shell with returned `user`; `401`/network failure clears token and shows auth modal. Register/login success writes token then enters shell using the response `user` (auto-login; optional immediate `/me` is allowed but not required).","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":86,"content":"| Cookie/`HttpOnly` sessions | MARATHON-3 fixed opaque Bearer + `huddle.token`; changing storage breaks the declared SPA/WS/IRC token story |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":97,"content":"| MARATHON-3 | `UserObj` seven string fields; register/login/me envelopes; errors `{ \"error\": string }`; username `^[A-Za-z0-9_]{1,32}$`; password length ≥ 8; `huddle.token`; Bearer header; no email required |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":98,"content":"| MARATHON-4 (design only) | Future profile PATCH; on `401` clear `huddle.token` and show login — same logout path this shell owns |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":104,"content":"Design complete for SPA shell auth UI. Consumes MARATHON-3 C1–C3; static public/ served from GET / on every node; huddle.token + pinned testids; logout is client-only. Handing to review (frontend implementer after architect label cleared). Cross-port localStorage is origin-scoped — not required.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":152,"content":"- Does every acceptance criterion in the design hold? Check them one at a time, including the negative ones.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-195351-qa-engineer-1--9410f589/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":44,"content":"- You write and run tests against the design's acceptance criteria. Tests, fixtures, and test helpers are yours to write.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":79,"content":"- Copy the design's acceptance criteria into an explicit list, including every negative case","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-195112-app-architect-1--25a50545/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":56,"content":"A task is already claimed for you: **MARATHON-21**. Work on that one and no other.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":58,"content":"ID: MARATHON-21","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":67,"content":"Serve SPA from GET / on any node. Sign-up/login form with visible validation errors; auto-login on success; logout/login restores workspace. Store token in localStorage huddle.token. Pin data-testid: auth-form, auth-submit, auth-toggle, current-user, logout-btn; ids auth-modal. Drivable at 1280x900.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-194900-qa-engineer-1--cbfb652f/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":44,"content":"- You write and run tests against the design's acceptance criteria. Tests, fixtures, and test helpers are yours to write.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":79,"content":"- Copy the design's acceptance criteria into an explicit list, including every negative case","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-194424-qa-engineer-1--b91bbc7c/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":44,"content":"- You write and run tests against the design's acceptance criteria. Tests, fixtures, and test helpers are yours to write.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":79,"content":"- Copy the design's acceptance criteria into an explicit list, including every negative case","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-194422-backend-dev-1--549e5981/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":128,"content":"- Read the whole design: contract, data model, edge cases, acceptance criteria","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":156,"content":"- Walk every acceptance criterion in the design, including the negative ones","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"../ws/sessions/20260822-194150-qa-engineer-1--4c8b061f/prompt.txt","matches":[{"lineNumber":44,"content":"- You write and run tests against the design's acceptance criteria. Tests, fixtures, and test helpers are yours to write.","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineN